  "html": "<h1 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 22px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>『影石Insta360 X5』全景运动相机</strong></span></h1><h2 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>1. 车载全景拍摄</strong></span></h2><table style=\"width: auto;table-layout: fixed;height:392\"><colgroup contentEditable=\"false\"><col width=317></col><col width=313></col><col width=351></col></colgroup><tbody><tr style=\"height: 30px\"><th colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">车门外安装</span></th><th colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">天幕安装</span></th><th colSpan=\"1\" rowSpan=\"1\" width=\"auto\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">中控台安装</span></th></tr><tr style=\"height: 362px\"><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/711c80d4bc954ad4af5cbb4b078ff3fd.jpg?auth_key=1795677429-64e39ff5a2b94a53a07645fea5efafd5-0-cfd2e2216de4953dfb653376fa3fa3a78d444dbcdadccdc9e55019205cc31167\" alt=\"影石2.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 257.91px;height: 320.10px;\"></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/d9229bd78de04f1380cbe3204a6b2604.jpg?auth_key=1795677429-3328272256274c6db2c841a105d3c9bf-0-acc86cd569f3413ce0f0c434132114e3e187d6637fe1c18483492a81051577be\" alt=\"2.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 256.19px;height: 318.71px;\"></td><td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" width=\"auto\" style=\"text-align: center; border-style: solid; border-color: rgb(204, 204, 204);\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/6270df47b4194ff69d8d906d4c59ff83.jpg?auth_key=1795677429-0db3f59d38254378b412c838e02313c0-0-8051fe58a2ca6cb9d8c3efeaa3866fe0aa7962b541c73e257d57ce069315780c\" alt=\"影石3.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 306.18px;height: 274.57px;\"></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><h2 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>2. 车机App“灵影”</strong></span></h2><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>为您深度定制，打造专属车机应用App——“灵影”</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">比亚迪为影石Insta360 X5全景运动相机打造专属的车机App——“灵影”，用户可以在车机应用市场下载灵影App实现对相机的控制。X5全景运动相机通过Wi-Fi与车机连接，用户通过车机大屏的“灵影”App，实现对相机的预览、拍摄、设置参数等操作。 &nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"> <img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/9146d9aaed024c56a1f33f348e1628ea.png?auth_key=1795677429-29b488d1eaee47aba3422b868a2bac34-0-8e471aa787df728c4d4000518203b54764d4a0f817e5ad7bdbeec85e03707b81\" alt=\"灵影相机-59-111灵影旅拍_启动页.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 396.80px;height: 433.52px;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/df2dc732e3f549bdbf3665dc11e47e75.png?auth_key=1795677429-73667a89247845da96ae261c06538018-0-523b6294d9f8db7cec0fb9b31d4735ff330a57e2053ad333fec362e6208e96bc\" alt=\"灵影相机-40-611灵影旅拍_全景影像_夜景录像x5.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 400.80px;height: 437.90px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px;\">图 2-1 车机“灵影”App</span></p><h2 style=\"text-align: left;\"><br><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>3. 车机大屏控制</strong></span></h2><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">车机大屏操控，功能丰富，显示效果</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">卓越。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">车机大屏上“灵影”App 控制相机的功能有：</span></p><ul><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">实时预览；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">拍照、录像；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">切换拍摄模式；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">设置参数；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">文件管理等；</span></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/637eb26ed29945adb58eb6b12ec5e2ac.png?auth_key=1795677429-73efd5f1f0e44720918d7e5d71d1978e-0-acbc5b7b6e84844e51011a45b8a151bbdb5ce7c90d81db1269442b157ac05249\" alt=\"灵影相机-39-621灵影旅拍_全景影像_夜景录像x5_设置.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 600.80px;height: 656.41px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px;\">图 3-1 车机大屏设置相机参数</span></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/4268e4393b144f8e9477617198fd2d29.png?auth_key=1795677429-a72fba2e25284bc386929ad902afa087-0-d3396f55751dbbad123c06b78acfae21dffe325aa8d6cc564df181f5a32adbbe\" alt=\"灵影相机-19-513灵影旅拍_sd卡_编辑.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 592.80px;height: 647.67px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px;\">图 3-2 车机大屏管理相机文件</span></p>"
